  "description": "YITAMOTOR is one of the largest automotive running boards and vehicle accessories retailers in the United States. We take pride in our quality control to assuring that providing only the highest quality running boards and auto accessories to our customers.\nFitment\n2009-2018 Dodge Ram 1500 Crew Cab\n2019-2024 Dodge Ram 1500 Classic\n2010-2026 Dodge Ram 2500/3500\nFeatures\nCompatibility: YITAMOTOR side steps for 2009-2018 Dodge Ram 1500 Crew Cab, 2019-2024 1500 Classic, 2010-2026 2500/3500; Easy no-drill installation\nTwo-Stair Layout: Unique two-stair layout makes these running boards easy for all ages to step in and out of the vehicle; The raised center step offers convenience for placing luggage or items on the roof\nHeavy-Duty Carbon Steel: YITAMOTOR running boards are made from high-quality carbon steel to offer sturdiness, durability, and the ability to support up to 550 LBS without deformation\nNon-Slip Design: The hollow design prevents water and sediment accumulation, keeping the running boards dry and clean; This feature enhances safety and durability by reducing the risk of slipping\nWeather Resistant: The surface is covered with a dual-stage textured black powder that withstands heavy rain and snowstorms, offering exceptional rust and corrosion resistance\nProfessional installation recommended",
